{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e17-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "寸步不离的心思  (Staying Right by His Side)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sitting beside Chun Yuqiao's bed, Kaiwen tells him what the night-shift staff witnessed in the Chief Editor's Office on the night of the storm broadcast. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你别再纠结了行不行？小谷那丫头的心思，傻子都看得出来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那天在总编室里，人家都去下狠手了，那丫头还对你寸步不离呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他下什么狠手了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我听值班的人都说了，那天夜里那个小子去了总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "估计就是你睡着那会儿，他给小谷送了一枚戒指。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "逼得他连这招都使出来了，就差给小谷跪下了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "最近事情太多，我居然把他给忘了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "忘了就忘了吧，你根本不用在乎他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "依我看，小谷根本就不喜欢他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "她的心思全都在你身上啊！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你别再纠结了行不行？小谷那丫头的心思，傻子都看得出来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop tying yourself in knots, alright? Even a fool can see how Xiaogu feels.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那天在总编室里，人家都去下狠手了，那丫头还对你寸步不离呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That night in the office, even when her suitor pulled out all the stops, she never left your side.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他下什么狠手了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What big move did he pull?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我听值班的人都说了，那天夜里那个小子去了总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone on night duty told me that fellow showed up at the editorial office late that night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "估计就是你睡着那会儿，他给小谷送了一枚戒指。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Probably right while you were asleep, he presented Xiaogu with a ring.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "逼得他连这招都使出来了，就差给小谷跪下了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Desperation drove him to pull a stunt like that—he stopped just short of kneeling to her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "最近事情太多，我居然把他给忘了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With so much happening lately, I actually forgot all about him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "忘了就忘了吧，你根本不用在乎他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good riddance if you forgot—you do not need to care about him at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "依我看，小谷根本就不喜欢他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The way I see it, Xiaogu does not like him one bit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "她的心思全都在你身上啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Her heart is completely set on you!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你别再纠结了行不行？小谷那丫头的心思，傻子都看得出来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那天在总编室里，人家都去下狠手了，那丫头还对你寸步不离呢。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他下什么狠手了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我听值班的人都说了，那天夜里那个小子去了总编室。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "估计就是你睡着那会儿，他给小谷送了一枚戒指。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "逼得他连这招都使出来了，就差给小谷跪下了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "最近事情太多，我居然把他给忘了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "忘了就忘了吧，你根本不用在乎他。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "依我看，小谷根本就不喜欢他。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "她的心思全都在你身上啊！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Kaiwen assures Chun Yuqiao that despite the wealthy suitor's grand gesture with a ring, Bu Xiaogu's heart is entirely with him. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
